29
00:01:37,007 --> 00:01:40,611
Then comes the stretch that separates this from a tool tutorial.

30
00:01:40,611 --> 00:01:45,060
Sections 6 through 9 are pre-flight, testing, reading results, and scaling what

31
00:01:45,060 --> 00:01:45,398
